{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person indie horror experience set in an abandoned rural village shrouded in mystery.</strong><br>The place looks frozen in time \u2014 homes left open, belongings scattered, and no sign of what happened to the people who once lived here. As you move deeper into the village, strange sounds and subtle movements hint that something is still lurking in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a slow-burn, atmospheric horror game focused on exploration, tension, and environmental storytelling. There are no weapons, no easy escapes \u2014 only your flashlight, your instincts, and the unsettling feeling that you\u2019re being watched.<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Village</strong><br>Explore a detailed rural environment filled with hidden paths, abandoned homes, and clues about the tragedy that struck this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Tension</strong><br>The horror comes from the environment itself \u2014 the soundscapes, the loneliness, and the sense that something is following you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Find notes, solve small environmental challenges, and piece together the story as you move from house to house.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764520?t=1769093193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764520?t=1769093193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764520/70ec7d18231b740cd82d49348fc44a50d4e1ffb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769093193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764520/70ec7d18231b740cd82d49348fc44a50d4e1ffb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769093193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person indie horror experience set in an abandoned rural village shrouded in mystery.</strong><br>The place looks frozen in time \u2014 homes left open, belongings scattered, and no sign of what happened to the people who once lived here. As you move deeper into the village, strange sounds and subtle movements hint that something is still lurking in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a slow-burn, atmospheric horror game focused on exploration, tension, and environmental storytelling. There are no weapons, no easy escapes \u2014 only your flashlight, your instincts, and the unsettling feeling that you\u2019re being watched.<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Village</strong><br>Explore a detailed rural environment filled with hidden paths, abandoned homes, and clues about the tragedy that struck this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Tension</strong><br>The horror comes from the environment itself \u2014 the soundscapes, the loneliness, and the sense that something is following you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Find notes, solve small environmental challenges, and piece together the story as you move from house to house.</p>","developers":["Oprex Balkan"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764520/fb877556cc4dffcf042a60155c7d94f0f03bc071/header.jpg?t=1769093193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong